{title: Haal Kya Hai Dilon Ka}
{artist: Kishore Kumar Laxmikant Pyarelal}
{key: Dm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Dm],        Haal kya hai dilo ka na pucho sanam
[A#] [C] [Dm],        Aapka muskurana gazab dha gaya
[Dm],        Ek to mehfil tumhari hasin kam na thi
[A#] [C] [Dm],        Us pe mera tarana gazab dha gaya
[Dm] [F],        Ab to lehraya masti bhari chhanv me
[A#] [A] [Dm],        Bandh lo chahe ghunghru mere paanv me
[Dm],        Main behakta nahi tha magar kya karu
[A#] [C] [Dm],        Aaj mausam suhana gazab dha gaya
[Dm] [F],        Har nazar uth rahi hai tumhari taraf
[A#] [A] [Dm],        Aur tumhari nazar hai hamari taraf
[Dm],        Aankh uthana tumhara to phir theek tha
[A#] [C] [Dm],        Aankh uthakar jhukana gazab dha gaya
[Dm] [F],        Mast aankhon ka jaadu jo shaamil hua
[A#] [A] [Dm],        Mera gana bhi sun-ne ke kaabil hua
[Dm],        Jisko dekho wohi aaj behos hai
[A#] [C] [Dm],        Aaj to main deewana gazab dha gaya
